 is unfortunately the usual grey trash that makes telling enemies apart from... ANYTHING difficult. Unless you explicitly know that the incoming object is an enemy, it will take you conscious processing to determine what it is. This is the main reason for why recommend AGAINST playing this game. Luckily it is just one campaign, so the eye strain is not extreme.\n\nYou gotta love team mates that run into your line of fire in hopes of doing a better job with their awful technician weapons.\n\nPlay it and then move on to the 2017 sequel Alien Swarm: Reactive Drop.\n\nCurator True Game Truths is right about one thing: Wildcat is pretty great as a character.", "timestamp_created": 1745786861, "timestamp_updated": 1745786861, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "193666220", "author": {"steamid": "76561199560955826", "personaname": "ツ | Hua", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199560955826/", "num_games_owned": 113, "num_reviews": 150, "playtime_forever": 86, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 86, "last_played": 1713095989, "avatar": "7555252c4b6cb5487ae80543ad6ab1cb2a09fa63"}, "language": "english", "review": "---{ Graphics }---\n☐ You forget what reality is\n☐ Beautiful\n☐ Good\n☑ Decent\n☐ Bad\n☐ Don‘t look too long at it\n☐ MS-DOS\n\n---{ Gameplay }---\n☐ Very good\n☐ Good\n☑ It's just gameplay\n☐ Mehh\n☐ Watch paint dry instead\n☐ Just don't\n\n---{ Audio }---\n☐ Eargasm\n☐ Very good\n☑ Good\n☐ Not too bad\n☐ Bad\n☐ I'm now deaf\n\n---{ Audience }---\n☑ Kids\n☑ Teens\n☑ Adults\n☐ Grandma\n\n---{ PC Requirements }---\n☐ Check if you can run paint\n☐ Potato\n☑ Decent\n☐ Fast\n☐ Rich boi\n☐ Ask NASA if they have a spare computer\n\n-